88,0,Main power undervoltage protection(AC insulation detection 2),Main circuit power supply OFF was detected when the preset value of 6007h (Abort connection option code) is 1 and the PDS state is ¡°Operation Enabled¡± or ¡°Quick stop active¡±.,"The capacity rise of power supply voltage. A power supply is changed. The cause by which the magnetic contactor of the main power supply fell is removed, and a power supply is switched on again."
