92,0,Encoder data recovery error protection,"In the absolute mode with semi-closed control, internal position data has not been correctly initialized.",Regulate the power source of the encoder to 5VDC ¡¾5% (4.75?5.25V). Measure the voltage at the encoder cable end if it is long.
,,,,"If the motor cable and encoder cable are bundled together, separated them."
