92,1,External scale data recovery error protection,"In the absolute mode with full-closed control, internal position data has not been correctly initialized.",Regulate the power source of the external scale to 5VDC ¡¾5% (4.75?5.25V).¡¦Measure the voltage at the external scale connection cable end if it is long.
